{"id":"n30189-1-16","stage":1,"title":"일주일 · 一周","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30189-1-16-1","ko":"뭘 이렇게 많이 샀어?","zh":"怎么买了这么多东西啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀어","audio":"/audio/99447433ba1c04adef5e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3319bd24cf81db3477a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30189-1-16-2","ko":"나는 일요일에 일주일 치 장을 다 봐 놓거든.","zh":"我每周日都会把一周要用的东西都买好呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"일요일에","meaning":"星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天","explanation":"일요일：星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일요일","audio":"/audio/1094b7d96a9a4109f162.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30198","senseId":"1","lemma":"일요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일요일에","audio":"/audio/a62ae93dc083392ee70d.mp3"}},{"text":"일주일","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}},{"text":"치","meaning":"一定的份儿或量。","explanation":"치：一定的份儿或量。","readings":[{"term":"치","audio":"/audio/5b910cd1473d913c6c85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79054","senseId":"3","lemma":"치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치","audio":"/audio/5b910cd1473d913c6c85.mp3"}},{"text":"장을","meaning":"酱","explanation":"장：酱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73818","senseId":"2","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장을","audio":"/audio/3847ce06b48f1fa6762d.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","aud